  "description": "Day-in, day-out the Tradewind HD keeps trucking. If one were to design a cruiser durability contest, the Tradwind HD would promptly take the cake. Every part (chain included) is rust-resistant, and each component is chosen to go the distance: a sealed bottom bracket, thorn-proof inner tubes, a quality quick release, alloy handlebars, a durable headset. While designed to exceed the needs of the rental market, it's equally at home for anyone hard on gear, because the Tradewind HD keeps on truckin' for more.\nAluminum frame, components, and crank keep things rust-free and rolling for the long haul\nKMC Rust-Buster chain defies salty environments and an outside-of-the-garage life\nThorn proof tubes keep the Tradewind HD rolling and flat-tire free\nAlloy quick-release seat binder makes saddle positioning simple for riders of varying heights\nPedal-forward positioning allows for full leg extension while easily putting a foot down at a stop sign",
